  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "4ce2b26b-bee9-c64c-95ee-d3f10b945ecc"],
 " source expansion nodal method(SENM), the fission and scattering sources \
are approximated using a quartic polynomial.\nGiven the RHS as a quartic \
polynomial, the analytic solution is obtained as following:"
}], "Text",
